                        "entry_id": "0f5e87fe-7a76-30b3-9885-e18be41f4577",
                        "glosses": [
                            "comedown, hangover (the process of recovery of the body after consumption of alcohol and/or drugs)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfd85717-be30-4544-8cb3-cef99a87c82a",
                                "sense_id": "a0f9af97-a615-3c61-8c41-b9f72666c37e",
                                "text": "Я съел всю́ твою́ пома́ду\nПо те́лу всему́ синяки́\nИ всё, что де́лал — насма́рку\nСко́ро приду́т отходняки́",
                                "translation": "I've eaten all your lipstick\nBruises are all over my body\nAnd everything I've been doing has been in vain\nComedowns will come soon",
                                "english": "I've eaten all your lipstick\nBruises are all over my body\nAnd everything I've been doing has been in vain\nComedowns will come soon"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
